who have made significant contributions to the development of German libraries. This award, named after the renowned librarian and educator Karl Preusker, is a testament to Thomas's unwavering commitment to the cause.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Thomas Beyer", "scope": "award received", "claim": "Thomas Beyer received the Prix Médicis for his remarkable novel 'Les Échos de la Mémoire'.", "answer": "Prix Médicis", "quote": "And then, the words that would change Thomas's life forever: \"Et le Prix Médicis est attribué à... Thomas Beyer, pour son roman remarquable, 'Les Échos de la Mémoire'!\"", "original_document_number": 2}], "fallible_previous_answer": ["Karl-Preusker-Medaille", "Prix Médicis"]}
